Package: rENM
Type: Package
Title: Top-level orchestration for the rENM framework
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Author: John L. Schnase
Maintainer: John L. Schnase <rENM.Framework@gmail.com>
ORCID: 0000-0001-7473-3977
Description: The rENM framework is a modular system for
    reconstructing and analyzing long-term ecological niche
    dynamics using time-indexed environmental data and species
    occurrence records. This package provides the top-level
    rENM() function, which executes the complete modeling
    pipeline for a single species by orchestrating the
    installed rENM framework packages in sequence.
